          "end": 34.62,
          "en": "our recipe service in the recipes component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.62,
          "end": 39.62,
          "en": "So all the components in this area share the same instance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.72,
          "end": 43.44,
          "en": "But if we navigate away to the Shopping List area",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.44,
          "end": 46.11,
          "en": "the recipes component is destroyed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.11,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "and so is the instance of this service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 53.55,
          "en": "So what we need to do to ensure that our service survives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.55,
          "end": 57.78,
          "en": "is we need to add it to our app module here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 57.78,
          "end": 61.77,
          "en": "by adding it here, recipes, service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.77,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "recipe service, and adding the import too,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 69.99,
          "en": "we make sure that now we have one instance of the service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.99,
          "end": 73.77,
          "en": "all the time available as long as our app is running.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.77,
          "end": 77.64,
          "en": "So now if we add the spaghetti one more time,",
